  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Management Strengthening Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento y Modernizacin de la Administracin Fiscal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAMA WILL SUPPORT THE STATE MODERNIZATION THROUGH THE INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING OF TAXATION AND FINANCIAL ADMINISTRATION DEPUTY-SECRETARIATS AS TO INCREASE THE LEVEL OF RESOURCES COLLECTED AND TO IMPROVE THE EFFICIENCY IN THE MANAGMENT OF PUBLIC RESOURCES. SPECIFICALLY THE PROGRAMA WILL SUPPORT THE RELGULATORY FRAMEWORK, IMPROVE THE ORGANIZATIONAL STRUCTURE, STREAMLINE THE ADM. PROCESES AND PROCEDURE, CREATE AN ADMS CONTOL SYSTEMS AND DELIVER TRAINING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
